An unterminated container does not extend the item past a blank line

```
- ::: d
  b

tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="d">
      <p>b</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>tail</p>
```

```
- ::: d
  b
tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="d">
      <p>b
tail</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- ::: d
  b

  tail
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="d">
      <p>b</p>
      <p>tail</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```
